  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞３Ｆ　“占卜馆”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉似乎很在意里面，\n　不时偷偷张望。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A8 07}……啊，{F1 81}。\n我说，玛格丽特小姐可怕吗？\n是不是说话很直接？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D6 07}本来想请她占卜的，\n可要是被一针见血地说中，\n感觉我会缓不过来……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉似乎犹豫不决。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞向由加莉讲了Ｘ先生的委托。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 46 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}Ｘ先生……\n这人的想法很像顺平呢。\n是个什么样的人？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}初出茅庐的魔术师{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}占卜师的徒弟{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:4:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}见习心理咨询师{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 EC 07}哦。魔术好像挺有意思，\n不过既然才刚入门，\n就不能期待太多吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉似乎不感兴趣……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C2 07}哦，还有这样的人啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}……啊，不过不管是谁，\n应该都不会比玛格丽特小姐更直接。\n让那个人占卜也不错呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉似乎产生了兴趣。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 EC 07}哦，还有这样的人啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7E 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}……不过，被人分析会有点可怕，\n我就不想见了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉似乎不感兴趣……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 37 08}嗯，有时间再说吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 08}好了……\n要不要向迪奥先生\n打听一下玛格丽特小姐呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉离开了占卜馆前。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e810_822.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞继续逛逛吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
